# secret-scan.sh allowlist for claude-skills-central.
# Two forms:  path:<regex>  (skip whole file)   |   <regex>  (skip matching lines)
# Keep entries narrow and say why. This repo is PUBLIC.

# The scanner's own test suite is deliberately full of credential-shaped
# fixtures (fake AWS keys, a fake private-key banner, the hex string from the
# 2026-09-19 incident). Without this the gate blocks every nightly backup.
# None of these are live: they are literals inside assertions.
path:^scripts/secret-scan\.test\.sh$
